<title>USA: SBE Inc chairman resigned in Q4.</title>
<headline>SBE Inc chairman resigned in Q4.</headline>
<dateline>SAN RAMON, Calif. 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>SBE Inc said Tuesday that its chairman, William Gage, resigned during the fourth quarter to pursue other interests.</p>
<p>The company said that for the present, William Heye, president and chief executive officer, will assume Gage's responsibilities.</p>
